      "q": "How much does the federal government award through WOSB set-asides?",
      "a": "The federal government awarded $616M through WOSB set-asides in FY2026 to date. The program generated 2,055 awards with an average award size of $300K and obligations fell 51.4% year over year. Prior fiscal-year totals were larger, including $1.3B in FY25 and FY24."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which agencies use WOSB set-asides the most?",
      "a": "The Department of Defense uses WOSB set-asides the most, obligating $306M in FY2026 to date. The Department of Homeland Security obligated $81.8M and the Department of Commerce obligated $50.9M. Other buyers include the Department of Health and Human Services at $39.1M and the Department of Justice at $23.7M."
    },
    {
      "q": "Who are the largest WOSB set-aside contractors?",
